    "calendar_writer": "Only the designated external worker mutates Calendar.",
    "calendar_range": "Scan complete supported monthly tabs and FU/All for identity safety. Eligibility follows the current schedule date in Asia/Taipei, including all of today. Skip Calendar requests while that date remains past. When a past schedule moves to today or later, resume reconciliation of the same bound Calendar event even if its cached or actual event date is past; preserve ScheduleSyncId and CalendarEventId. Missing-source past or undated events remain protected from deletion. Archive identities protect existing events without creating archive events.",
    "calendar_host": "One registered host per spreadsheet and target calendar. Claim fixed DOCUMENT metadata ID atomically; include a machine-specific host fingerprint as well as worker and target IDs. A different host or copied database must stop, without automatic replacement."
